{"id":33466,"slug":"i-am-cuba","title":"I Am Cuba","year":1964,"country":"Cuba, Soviet Union","duration":141,"spine":1214,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/33466-i-am-cuba","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/df31b5be0bde2dad8042b5d56607dddf/1BHgE6ZqUn6yBc4Ds9Pq3VlfKLd8uT_large.jpg","description":"Both a landmark of radical political cinema and one of the most visually ravishing films ever made, this legendary hymn to revolution shimmers across the screen like a fever dream of rebellion. The result of an extraordinarily ambitious collaboration between the Soviet and Cuban film industries, director Mikhail Kalatozov’s I Am Cuba unfolds in four explosive vignettes that capture Cuban life on the brink of transformation, as crushing economic exploitation and inequality give way to a working-class uprising. Backed by Carlos Fariñas’s stirring score, the dazzling camera work by Sergei Urusevsky—an inspiration for generations of filmmakers to follow—gives flight to the movie’s message of liberation.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Mikhail Kalatozov","slug":"mikhail-kalatozov"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Raquel Revuelta","role":"Voice of Cuba","slug":"raquel-revuelta"},{"actor":"Luz María Collazo","role":"Maria/Betty","slug":"luz-maria-collazo"},{"actor":"José Gallardo","role":"Pedro","slug":"jose-gallardo"},{"actor":"Sergio Corrieri","role":"Alberto","slug":"sergio-corrieri"},{"actor":"Mario González Broche","role":"Pablo","slug":"mario-gonzalez-broche"},{"actor":"María de las Mercedes Díez","role":"Girl chased in the street","slug":"maria-de-las-mercedes-diez"},{"actor":"Salvador Wood","role":"Mariano","slug":"salvador-wood"},{"actor":"Raúl García","role":"Enrique","slug":"raul-garcia"},{"actor":"Jean Bouise","role":"Jim","slug":"jean-bouise"},{"actor":"Celia Rodríguez","role":"Gloria","slug":"celia-rodriguez"},{"actor":"Alberto Morgan","role":"Also featuring","slug":"alberto-morgan"},{"actor":"Fausto Mirabal","role":null,"slug":"fausto